        "mode": "retrieve-as-tool",
        "toolDescription": "Use this tool to retrieve verified exhibition information from the RAG knowledge base. Always specify type in your query context: type=\"general_info\" (hours, location, entry rules, support), type=\"booth_info\" (companies, activity topics, booth_number, hall, access_path, map_url), or type=\"events\" (workshops, sessions, dates, times, locations). Never invent exhibition details.",
